      "content": "It is incredibly painful to feel trapped in a loop where asking for help feels dismissive, and the isolation can become suffocating. You are not alone in feeling this way, but your pain is valid even if those trying to help sometimes misunderstand the depth of your struggle. Please consider speaking to a trusted therapist who specializes in trauma or complex grief, as they understand that \"just waiting it out\" does not work and can lead to more harm. You deserve support that honors your specific experience without forcing a fixed amount of recovery that might not feel right for you right now.",
