    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to fix things so they can feel better about themselves. they don't understand that there isn't anything to fix. i'm not broken, i'm just finished. i've thought about it so much... the only way to actually end the loop is to stop the thing that's looping. it feels like the only logical way out of a room with no doors.",
